{"parentUuid":"fb31584a-b021-4b6e-a013-6d4f91a7001c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfuby9HApJohZoF7e7RLr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I'm planning to add a word-timing step to the narration script: for each line, check if a words.json file exists and matches the current text, and if not, transcribe the mp3 using fal's whisper endpoint with word-level chunks, then align those words to the script. I'm recalling the whisper input schema, including fields like audio_url, task, and language.\n\nI'm leaning toward fal-ai/whisper over wizper since I believe it supports word-level chunking, and I'll pass the audio as a base64 data URI since the files are small. I'll call the sync endpoint the same way narration does, using the no-store header for privacy, then align the returned word chunks against the script's words.\n\nSince whisper's numbers or punctuation might not match the script exactly, I need a normalized alignment — lowercasing, stripping punctuation, and falling back to a DP-based alignment (like Needleman-Wunsch) when word counts don't line up, interpolating timings for unmatched words. I'll write this alignment logic in JS as part of the narration script, outputting word-level timestamps to a words.json file so captions and accents can sync precisely, running it automatically whenever the cache is missing rather than gating it behind a flag.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3887,"cache_read_input_tokens":184233,"output_tokens":3108,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":857},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3887,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":3108,"cache_read_input_tokens":184233,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3887,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3887},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":11648,"thinkingDisplay":"summarized","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","attributionSkill":"hyperframes-core","type":"assistant","uuid":"621e7c36-4d83-46b9-99f0-7e81477c0b5d","timestamp":"2026-10-11T01:45:06.263Z","effort":"max","perTurnEffort":"max","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"/home/diogenes/Projects/apps/baste","sessionId":"69afbb2a-630d-41bd-9b69-0c77564d8af1","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"main","slug":"toasty-puzzling-hopcroft"}
{"parentUuid":"621e7c36-4d83-46b9-99f0-7e81477c0b5d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfuby9HApJohZoF7e7RLr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01NgvmqH65ox6BPwNe7pepF4","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\np='scripts/narrate-tour.mjs'\ns=open(p).read()\nold_doc=''' * Writes narration/<id>.mp3 and narration/timing.json, which the composition reads\n * to place each scene. The credential never enters an artifact.\n */'''\nnew_doc=''' * Writes narration/<id>.mp3 and narration/timing.json, which the composition reads\n * to place each scene, then times every word with fal Whisper (narration/words.json)\n * for captions. The credential never enters an artifact.\n */'''\nassert s.count(old_doc)==1; s=s.replace(old_doc,new_doc)\nold_tail='''await writeFile(resolve(output, 'timing.json'), JSON.stringify({ voice: 'Aria', total: +cursor.toFixed(3), scenes: timing }, null, 2) + '\\\\n');\nconsole.log(`Tour narration: ${cursor.toFixed(2)}s`);'''\nnew_tail='''await writeFile(resolve(output, 'timing.json'), JSON.stringify({ voice: 'Aria', total: +cursor.toFixed(3), scenes: timing }, null, 2) + '\\\\n');\nconsole.log(`Tour narration: ${cursor.toFixed(2)}s`);\n\n// Word timings: Whisper hears each line, and its words are matched back to the\n// script so captions keep the written spelling and punctuation.\nconst norm = word => word.toLowerCase().normalize('NFKD').replace(/[^a-z0-9]/g, '');\nfunction align(script, heard) {\n  const a = script.map(norm), b = heard.map(h => norm(h.text));\n  const L = Array.from({ length: a.length + 1 }, () => new Array(b.length + 1).fill(0));\n  for (let i = a.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) for (let j = b.length - 1; j >= 0; j--)\n    L[i][j] = a[i] && a[i] === b[j] ? L[i + 1][j + 1] + 1 : Math.max(L[i + 1][j], L[i][j + 1]);\n  const hit = new Array(a.length).fill(null);\n  for (let i = 0, j = 0; i < a.length && j < b.length;) {\n    if (a[i] && a[i] === b[j]) { hit[i] = heard[j]; i++; j++; }\n    else if (L[i + 1][j] >= L[i][j + 1]) i++; else j++;\n  }\n  // Words Whisper heard differently (\"25\" for \"twenty-five\") share the gap between matched neighbours.\n  const words = [];\n  for (let i = 0; i < script.length;) {\n    if (hit[i]) { words.push({ text: script[i], start: hit[i].start, end: hit[i].end }); i++; continue; }\n    let k = i; while (k < script.length && !hit[k]) k++;\n    const from = words.at(-1)?.end ?? heard[0]?.start ?? 0;\n    const to = hit[k]?.start ?? heard.at(-1)?.end ?? from;\n    const weight = script.slice(i, k).map(w => w.length + 1), total = weight.reduce((x, y) => x + y, 0);\n    let at = from;\n    for (let n = i; n < k; n++) { const d = (to - from) * weight[n - i] / total; words.push({ text: script[n], start: at, end: at + d }); at += d; }\n    i = k;\n  }\n  return words.map(w => ({ text: w.text, start: +w.start.toFixed(3), end: +w.end.toFixed(3) }));\n}\nconst allWords = [];\nfor (const scene of timing) {\n  const cache = resolve(output, `${scene.id}.words.json`);\n  let heard;\n  try {\n    const saved = JSON.parse(await readFile(cache, 'utf8'));\n    if (saved.text === scene.text) heard = saved.heard;\n  } catch { /* transcribe below */ }\n  if (!heard) {\n    const audio = await readFile(resolve(output, `${scene.id}.mp3`));\n    const response = await fetch('https://fal.run/fal-ai/whisper', {\n      method: 'POST', redirect: 'error',\n      headers: { Authorization: `Key ${key}`, 'Content-Type': 'application/json', 'X-Fal-Store-IO': '0' },\n      body: JSON.stringify({ audio_url: `data:audio/mpeg;base64,${audio.toString('base64')}`, task: 'transcribe', language: 'en', chunk_level: 'word', version: '3' }),\n      signal: AbortSignal.timeout(120000),\n    });\n    if (!response.ok) throw new Error(`Word timing ${scene.id}: fal returned ${response.status}.`);\n    const data = await response.json();\n    heard = (data.chunks ?? []).filter(c => Array.isArray(c.timestamp)).map(c => ({ text: String(c.text).trim(), start: Number(c.timestamp[0]), end: Number(c.timestamp[1] ?? c.timestamp[0]) }));\n    if (!heard.length) throw new Error(`Word timing ${scene.id}: no words came back.`);\n    await writeFile(cache, JSON.stringify({ model: 'fal-ai/whisper', text: scene.text, heard }, null, 2) + '\\\\n');\n  }\n  const words = align(scene.text.split(/\\\\s+/).filter(Boolean), heard);\n  allWords.push({ id: scene.id, voiceStart: scene.voiceStart, words: words.map(w => ({ ...w, start: +(scene.voiceStart + w.start).toFixed(3), end: +(scene.voiceStart + w.end).toFixed(3) })) });\n  console.log(`${scene.id}: ${words.length} words timed`);\n}\nawait writeFile(resolve(output, 'words.json'), JSON.stringify({ scenes: allWords }, null, 2) + '\\\\n');'''\nassert s.count(old_tail)==1; s=s.replace(old_tail,new_tail)\nopen(p,'w').write(s); print('ok')\nEOF\nnode --check scripts/narrate-tour.mjs && node scripts/narrate-tour.mjs --skate 2>&1 | tail -20","description":"Add fal Whisper word timing to the narration script and run it","timeout":600000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3887,"cache_read_input_tokens":184233,"output_tokens":3108,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":857},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3887,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":3108,"cache_read_input_tokens":184233,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3887,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3887},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01NgvmqH65ox6BPwNe7pepF4":{"command":"cd /home/diogenes/Projects/apps/baste && python3 - <<'EOF'\np='scripts/narrate-tour.mjs'\ns=ope