{"parentUuid":"4cfbf342-20f4-4877-801c-e84e600ff13e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfucG9iCHk3HX4yCCfZvK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"There's a tension here: the skill gates rendering behind user confirmation, but the overall instruction tells me to proceed without asking further questions. Since I'm told to continue autonomously, I should note this conflict in my report rather than stopping to ask the user whether to render.\n\nNow I need to pin down the precise timing of events in the footage—token tab clicks, talk events, archive events, typing—so I can place cuts accurately, which I'll do by analyzing frame differences in cropped regions with ffmpeg's scene detection.\n\nI'm narrowing in on the tabs region in the footage, estimating pixel coordinates for the \"CSS variables | Tailwind | Panda | JSON\" row, and planning to crop around the code block and tabs to run scene detection with a lower threshold. I also need to account for cursor movement potentially triggering false positives, so I'm considering using ffmpeg's scene score metadata output per frame as a cleaner way to detect actual transitions versus cursor jitter.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":926,"cache_read_input_tokens":213145,"output_tokens":1327,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":905},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":926,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1327,"cache_read_input_tokens":213145,"cache_creation_input_tokens":926,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":926},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"diagnostics":null,"context_managemen