{"parentUuid":"4cabde64-0e8d-49b3-8b91-26241fc0dd38","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"a21b9370-2685-47ed-b11e-b7c9dc33e565","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NtetSAmdcXvK8bnWAGddpR","type":"tool_result","content":"{act(form.dryRun ? \"baste\" : form.provider === \"notorganic\" ? \"spend\" : \"cut\", css({ w: \"100%\", mt: 5, h: \"46px\" }\n\"archive-map\"\n\"archive-map-axis archive-map-axis--x\"\n\"archive-map-axis archive-map-axis--y\"\n\"archive-map-cell\"\n\"archive-map-frame\"\n\"archive-map-grid\"\n\"archive-map-head\"\n\"archive-map-score\"\n\"archive-map-tried\"\n186:        <h2 id=\"gen-title\" class={panelTitle}>Generate assets</h2>\n211:              id=\"gen-provider\"\n228:            {hosted ? <select id=\"gen-model\" class={input} value={form.model} onChange$={(_, el) => (form.model = el.value)}>\n231:            </select> : <input id=\"gen-model\" class={input} value={form.model} placeholder=\"Use server default\" onInput$={(_, el) => (form.model = el.value)} />}\n260:          <input id=\"gen-maxcost\" class={input} type=\"number\" inputMode=\"decimal\" min=\"0.01\" step=\"0.01\" value={form.maxCostUsd}\n263:          <p id=\"gen-maxcost-hint\" class={hint}>QD generates and judges multiple candidates. Baste checks the conservative request budget before generation and stops at your maximum; actual debits are determined by the provider.</p>\n295:          <h2 id=\"gen-progress\" class={panelTitle}>{job.value ? (job.value.status === \"running\" ? \"In progress\" : job.value.status === \"completed\" ? \"Finished\" : \"Stopped\") : \"Nothing on the table yet\"}</h2>\n393:              <h2 id=\"gen-prompts\" class={panelTitle}>How Baste will brief the models</h2>\n421:              <h2 id=\"gen-history\" class={panelTitle}>Earlier runs</h2>\nstudio/tabs/tokens.tsx:46:            <h2 id=\"tok-title\" class={panelTitle}>Design tokens</h2>\nfitting/fitting-room.tsx\nfitting/fitting-room.css\nfitting/fitting-room.tsx:128